      "id": "api",
      "name": "API",
      "type": "backend"
    },
    {
      "canvas": {
        "widgets": [
          {
            "data": {
              "text": "Owns truth.yaml, the single origin of all facts (truth/). Extracts text from an uploaded CV in any supported format — PDF (pypdf), DOCX (python-docx), TXT or Markdown — uses a provider to build a structured truth file (every role/company/date/bullet/skill tagged source:uploaded-cv with a stable id), and builds/validates/persists it. Legacy entries tagged linkedin-pdf remain valid. User-confirmed inferences are tagged user-confirmed."
            },
            "h": 180,
            "id": "widget-1783591752580-0",
            "title": "Intent & Scope Description",
            "type": "text",
            "w": 350,
            "x": 30,
            "y": 30
          },
          {
            "data": {
              "techs": [
                "Python",
                "pypdf",
                "PyYAML",
                "python-docx"
              ]
            },
            "h": 200,
            "id": "widget-1783591752683-1",
            "title": "Tech Stack Profiles",
            "type": "techstack",
            "w": 350,
            "x": 60,
            "y": 60
          },
          {
            "data": {
              "fields": [
                {
                  "flags": "stable id",
                  "name": "id",
                  "notes": "Referenced by the tailor engine when selecting facts.",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "flags": "-",
                  "name": "kind",
                  "notes": "role | company | date | bullet | skill",
                  "type": "enum"
                },
                {
                  "flags": "-",
                  "name": "value",
                  "notes": "The factual content.",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "flags": "provenance",
                  "name": "source",
                  "notes": "linkedin-pdf | user-confirmed — the trust tag.",
                  "type": "enum"
                }
              ]
            },
            "h": 240,
            "id": "widget-1783591788649-2",
            "title": "truth.yaml entry",
            "type": "schema",
            "w": 440,
            "x": 90,
            "y": 90
          },
          {
            "data": {
              "text": "TruthEntry.kind ∈ {role, company, date, bullet, skill}; TruthEntry.source ∈ {linkedin-pdf, user-confirmed}. The store enforces non-empty, unique id and valid kind/source. Persisted YAML is wrapped as { entries: [...] }, not a bare list."
            },
            "h": 200,
            "id": "widget-1783605716326-3",
            "title": "Schema enums & envelope",
            "type": "note",
            "w": 350,
            "x": 120,
            "y": 120
          },
          {
            "data": {
              "fields": [
                {
                  "flags": "-",
