    {
      "canvas": {
        "widgets": [
          {
            "data": {
              "text": "Thin LLMProvider abstraction (providers/) with three implementations — anthropic | openai | ollama — selected by the LLM_PROVIDER env var. Interface: complete(system, messages) → str and extract_json(system, messages, schema) → dict. Adding a provider later = one new file; no truthfulness logic depends on which provider is active."
            },
